flowchart LR
  Dev[Developer] --> PR[Pull request]
  PR --> FMT[Terraform fmt + validate]
  PR --> IaC[Checkov + Trivy IaC]
  PR --> Secrets[Gitleaks]
  PR --> App[Pytest + Bandit + pip-audit]
  PR --> Image[Docker build + Trivy]
  FMT & IaC & Secrets & App & Image --> Gate{Checks pass?}
  Gate -->|yes| Review[Human review]
  Gate -->|no| Fix[Remediate]

